{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>Sixteen times</b> זבת חלב ודבש is written in the Torah, corresponding to \"I saw flowing milk and honey of all the Land of Israel,\" and it was sixteen parsot (by the width of a parsah).\n\n<b>As YHWH the Elohim of your fathers spoke to you.</b> And adjacent to it is <b>Hear O Israel</b>, which mentioned these names corresponding to the patriarchs: YHWH — corresponding to Abraham, for it is written of him \"אני ה' אשר…\" etc. Our Elohim — corresponding to Isaac, for it is written of him \"אנכי אלהי אברהם אביך\". YHWH is One — corresponding to Jacob, as stated of him \"אני ה'\"."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:08:57.662884308Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}